1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,890
Did we get paper towels?
我們買了紙巾嗎？

2
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:06,090
You mean the thing we went to the store for?
你是指我們打算 去店裡買的東西嗎？

3
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,700
Nope.
沒有

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,360
Hey, I got you a present!
我幫你們準備了一份禮物

5
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,970
Oh, my goodness, where did you hide it?
天啊，你把它藏在哪裡？

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:17,870
I ordered it for your wedding and it's finally here!
我訂了它當做你們結婚的禮物 它終於送來了

7
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,640
You didn't have to get us anything..
你不必送我們任何…

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,680
I love it! It's huge! Let's open it!
我喜歡它，它很大，我們打開它吧

9
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:30,410
-It's a Ms. Pac-Man machine! -Oh, my God!
-是小精靈的電動 -我的天啊

10
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,680
I didn't know where to put it.
我不知道該把它放到哪裡去

11
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:36,690
-We can put it in the guest bedroom. -Yeah, okay.
-我們可以把它放在客房 -好吧

12
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,260
I kind of like it here.
我喜歡把它放在這裡

13
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,660
Do you like it?
你喜歡它嗎？

14
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:47,810
I practically spent my entire childhood at the arcade.
我小時候 都待在遊樂場裡

15
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:51,340
-This was my second favorite. -What's your first?
-這是我第二喜歡的遊戲 -你最喜歡什麼？

16
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:55,110
-I don't remember the name. -Well, what did it do?
-我記不得它的名字了 -它的內容是什麼？

17
00:00:55,320 --> 00:01:00,480
You'd put a quarter in, pull some handles and win a candy bar.
把銅板放進去 一拉把手，就能拿到糖果

18
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:02,950
A vending machine?
自動販賣機？

19
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,920
Don't feel bad for me. I won every time!
別為我難過 每次我都會贏

20
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,693
The One Where Joey Dates Rachel
本集播出：喬伊跟瑞秋約會

00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,693
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:46,630
I'm so glad you guys are here.
我很高興你們都在

22
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:50,360
Guess what happened in the paleontology department.
猜猜古生物系 發生了什麼事

23
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:54,370
Do you think he saw us, or can we still slip out?
你覺得他看到了我們 還是我們有機會落跑？

24
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:58,740
Professor Newman, the department head, is retiring, so..
系主任諾曼教授 要退休了，所以…

25
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:04,040
-They made you head of the department! -I'm teaching his advanced class!
-他們讓你當系主任 -我要教他的高級課

26
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,650
Why didn't I get head of the department?
我為什麼沒有當上系主任？

27
00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:10,350
Great. You've always wanted to teach an advanced class.
太棒了 你一直想教高級課

28
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:14,720
No, I know. It's really exciting. This is the break I've been waiting for.
不，我知道，它真的很棒 這是我一直在期待的機會

29
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,300
I'm not sure a court-ordered detox program..
我相信強制抗過敏排毒計劃…

30
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:20,400
was the break Professor Newman was waiting for.
不是諾曼教授 在等待的機會

31
00:02:20,570 --> 00:02:21,560
But, hey.
但是…

32
00:02:22,770 --> 00:02:27,570
Hey, Rach, I got a big date. Do you know a good restaurant?
瑞秋，我有個重要約會 你知道哪家餐廳不錯嗎？

33
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:32,880
Paul's Cafe. It's got great food and it's really romantic.
保羅咖啡廳，那裡東西好吃 氣氛真的很浪漫

34
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,410
Great, thanks.
太棒了，謝謝

35
00:02:34,620 --> 00:02:38,110
Then take her to the Four Seasons for drinks.
帶她到四季飯店喝東西

36
00:02:38,790 --> 00:02:42,090
Or go downtown and listen to some jazz.
或是到城裡聽爵士樂

37
00:02:42,290 --> 00:02:44,880
Or dancing. Oh, take her dancing!
或跳舞，帶她去跳舞

38
00:02:45,090 --> 00:02:48,650
You sure are naming a lot of ways to postpone sex.
你真的很會拖延性愛遊戲

39
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:53,930
I miss dating. Dressing up, going to a fancy restaurant.
我想念約會的感覺 盛裝打扮去好餐廳吃飯

40
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:59,040
I won't be able to do that for so long. And it's so much fun.
我很久都無法再那麼做了 那真的很有趣

41
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:03,910
Not that sitting around worrying about giving birth isn't fun.
我不是說坐在這裡 擔心生產的事不好玩

42
00:03:05,410 --> 00:03:09,110
Hey, you know what? Why don't I take you out.
知道嗎？我們為什麼不去約會？

43
00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:12,350
You don't want to date a pregnant lady.
你不想跟孕婦約會

44
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:15,350
Yes, I do. We're gonna have a good time.
我想我們會玩得很開心

45
00:03:15,620 --> 00:03:20,060
I'll take your mind off of childbirth, and C-sections..
我會讓你忘了生孩子剖腹生產…

46
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,560
and baby heads stretching out..
寶寶的頭擴大了…

47
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,420
Okay, I'll go with you.
好吧，我答應你

48
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:27,070
-It will be fun. -All right.
-那會很好玩的 -好吧

49
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:29,170
No, no! Yes!
不，太棒了

50
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:32,170
Would you look at that.
快來看

51
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:35,670
I knocked off all your top scores. How sad.
我打敗了你的最佳成績 太慘了

52
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:37,170
Okay, I'm next.
好吧，輪到我了

53
00:03:37,450 --> 00:03:40,710
Don't start another game. I'm next! Phoebe?
別再開始 輪到我了，菲比

54
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:44,940
Sorry, I couldn't hear you over all the winning.
抱歉，我贏得太開心 聽不到你說話

55
00:03:45,250 --> 00:03:48,810
-Phoebe's hogging the game. -It's a stupid game.
-菲比在霸佔遊戲 -那是個愚蠢的遊戲

56
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:51,960
You think it's stupid because you suck.
你覺得它蠢 因為你很遜

57
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:55,090
I don't suck. It sucks.
我不遜，它才遜

58
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,590
You suck.
你很遜

59
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:03,900
If this game is gonna cause problems, I should keep it.
如果這遊戲會引起你們的困擾 我應該留下它

60
00:04:04,110 --> 00:04:06,970
No, I love it. It is a great present.
不，我喜歡它，它是很棒的禮物

61
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:11,270
Why don't you go home and wait for the thank-you card?
你為什麼不回家等謝卡呢？

62
00:04:11,510 --> 00:04:16,780
-Why do you want to play this game? -It doesn't spit out a Clark Bar.
-你為什麼要玩這個遊戲？ -它不會吐出糖果

63
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:20,680
Okay. Phoebe, that's it. Out of the chair.
好吧，菲比，夠了 快下來

64
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:24,490
Phoebe! Chandler!
菲比，錢德

65
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:28,560
No, no. This is a girl fight. I'm hoping it will turn into love-play.
不，這是女孩的戰爭 我希望你們能互敬互愛

66
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:33,600
Okay, look. Honey, I'm sorry..
好吧，聽著 我很抱歉…

67
00:04:33,770 --> 00:04:37,640
I'm acting hostile. I don't mean to. It's just that I love this game so much..
我太凶了，我不是故意的 我真的很喜歡這個遊戲…

68
00:04:37,810 --> 00:04:40,370
that I would just like the chance to play it too.
我也想玩玩它

69
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:43,870
Wow, it's amazing how well I can play with you yapping around my head..
太神奇了，你在我耳邊 像吉娃娃一樣叫個不停…

70
00:04:44,050 --> 00:04:45,030
like a Chihuahua.
我還是能玩

71
00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:49,880
All right, that's it. Chandler, help me get her out of the chair.
好吧，我受夠了，錢德 幫我把她拉下來

72
00:04:50,650 --> 00:04:52,810
Chandler, come on.
錢德，快點

73
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:05,730
Joey, could you get that?
喬伊，麻煩你去開門

74
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,360
Joey.
喬伊

75
00:05:18,410 --> 00:05:20,780
I thought you were in your room.
你這是幹嘛？ 我以為你在房裡

76
00:05:20,980 --> 00:05:24,420
I'm picking you up for our date. For you.
我是來接你的 這是送你的

77
00:05:26,090 --> 00:05:29,490
Lilies. They're my favorite. Thank you.
百合花，它們是我最喜歡的花 謝謝

78
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:32,730
And a brownie.
還有蛋糕

79
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:36,190
Well, half a brownie.
只有一半

80
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:38,560
Actually, it's just a bag.
事實上它只剩袋子

81
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:43,570
It's a long walk from the flower shop and I felt faint, so..
從花店走回來真的很遠 我覺得頭暈，所以…

82
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:48,770
This is so great! I actually feel like I'm on a real date.
這真的是太棒了 我覺得好像真的在約會

83
00:05:49,010 --> 00:05:54,210
But I have morning sickness and I have on underwear that goes up to..
但我會害喜 我穿的內褲褲頭高到…

84
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,910
there.
這裡

85
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,920
Hey, come on. This is a real date.
少來了，這是真的約會

86
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:01,590
So nice place you got here.
你家好漂亮

87
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:05,920
Football. Pizza box.
桌上足球，披薩盒

88
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:10,120
Oh, a subscription to Playboy. My kind of woman.
還有花花公子雜誌 你是我喜歡的那種女人

89
00:06:10,330 --> 00:06:12,300
That's my roommate's.
那是我室友的雜誌

90
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:16,300
I'd like to meet him. He sounds like a standup guy.
我想見見他 他似乎是個好男人

91
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:20,670
He's protective of me, so you'd better watch yourself.
他很保護我 你最好小心一點

92
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:23,740
Your roommate, is he good-looking?
你室友很帥嗎？

93
00:06:25,810 --> 00:06:29,010
Must be tough to keep your hands off him.
你一定很努力控制自己 不愛上他

94
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,380
I'm pretty sure he's gay.
我相信他是男同志

95
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:36,550
No! No, he's not! Why are you trying to ruin the game?
不是的 你為什麼要毀了這個遊戲？

96
00:06:38,330 --> 00:06:42,130
Which brings us back to Greely's Theory of Dominance.
這讓我想起葛瑞利的骨牌理論

97
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:44,290
That's it for today.
今天到此為止

98
00:06:44,770 --> 00:06:47,960
Does anyone know where the Freeman Building is?
有人知道費利曼樓在哪裡嗎？

99
00:06:48,170 --> 00:06:50,470
It's the new building on Avenue A.
那是A大道的新大樓

100
00:06:50,670 --> 00:06:54,700
That's across town. I'm teaching there in 10 minutes.
它在城裡的另一邊 我10分鐘內得趕到那裡上課

101
00:06:54,910 --> 00:06:57,070
Dude, that's not gonna happen.
那是不可能的

102
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,980
Move it! Move it!
快閃開

103
00:07:02,220 --> 00:07:04,680
Hey! I'm the teacher!
我是老師

104
00:07:18,230 --> 00:07:20,000
Hello.
哈囉

105
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:28,340
Sorry I'm a little late. Whoa, a lot late.
抱歉我遲到了 我嚴重遲到

106
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:32,310
Well, let me start by introducing myself.
我從自我介紹開始吧

107
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:34,910
I'm Professor Geller.
我是蓋勒教授

108
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:38,380
So to sum up..
總而言之…

109
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:42,580
I'm Professor Geller. Good job today.
我是蓋勒教授 今天大家做得很好

110
00:07:45,330 --> 00:07:49,190
-What comes with the filet mignon? -Steamed vegetables.
-菲力牛排搭配什麼？ -蒸蔬菜

111
00:07:52,330 --> 00:07:54,320
Instead of the vegetables..
除了蔬菜…

112
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:58,840
is there any way that I could substitute the..
我可以用什麼東西搭配…

113
00:07:59,070 --> 00:08:01,200
three-pound lobster?
三磅的龍蝦？

114
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,970
You know what? Bring her both.
知道嗎？幫她把兩道菜都送上來

115
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:07,580
And I'll have the same.
我要點跟她一樣的東西

116
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:11,840
Wow, this is shaping up to be a pretty good date.
這真的是個很棒的約會

117
00:08:12,050 --> 00:08:15,080
I almost forgot. I didn't pay you the rent.
我差點忘了 我沒給你房租

118
00:08:15,290 --> 00:08:17,550
No roommate stuff. It's a date.
別當我們是室友，我們在約會

119
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:22,390
Wow, so I get to see what Joey Tribbiani is like on a date.
我想知道喬伊崔比亞尼 怎麼跟女人約會

120
00:08:22,630 --> 00:08:23,890
Have any moves?
你有什麼招數？

121
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:28,500
No, I'm just myself, and if they don't like me for..
不，我只會做我自己 如果她們不喜歡我…

122
00:08:30,970 --> 00:08:34,070
I'm sorry, I couldn't even get through that.
抱歉 我無法想像那種事

123
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:37,480
I knew it. Tell me your moves.
我就知道，告訴我你有什麼招數

124
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:39,270
All right.
好吧

125
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,740
Well..
嗯…

126
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:45,780
I start by having a bottle of wine sent to my table from a fan.
我會假裝有影迷送一瓶紅酒給我們

127
00:08:45,990 --> 00:08:49,450
Oh, my God. And that works?
天啊，有用嗎？

128
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:54,990
If you add, "This is embarrassing. I just want to have a normal life."
你得加上「這真是太不好意思了 我只想過正常人的生活」

129
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,690
You poor little famous man.
你們這些可憐的名人

130
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:00,530
Okay, how about this one?
好吧，這個呢？

131
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:04,460
I was gonna wait until the end of the night to kiss you..
我本來想等到送你回家再吻你…

132
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:08,270
but you're just so beautiful, I don't think I can.
但你真的太美了 我想我做不到

133
00:09:10,180 --> 00:09:11,610
Oh, my God!
天啊

134
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:17,910
Wow, that was fantastic! I almost leaned in. Really.
那真的太棒了 我差點就被你騙了

135
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,280
So tell me one of your moves.
告訴我你用的是什麼招數

136
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:22,480
All right.
好吧

137
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,850
So where'd you grow up?
你是在哪裡長大的？

138
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:30,290
That's your move?
那就是你的招數？

139
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,360
Boy, Rach, you're lucky you're hot.
瑞秋，還好你長得很美

140
00:09:33,570 --> 00:09:37,530
-Come on, just answer the question. -Queens.
-快回答我的問題 -皇后區

141
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:40,140
Were you close to your parents?
你跟父母親近嗎？

142
00:09:40,470 --> 00:09:43,570
-With my mom. Not so much my dad. -Why not?
-我跟媽媽親，跟爸爸不太說話 -為什麼？

143
00:09:43,810 --> 00:09:46,840
I don't know. There's just this distance.
我不知道 我們之間有距離

144
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:50,640
We both try to pretend it's not there, but it is.
我們都假裝沒有 但事實上不然

145
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,810
It's gotta be rough.
那一定很辛苦

146
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:57,990
Yeah, it's really tough. Sometimes I think..
對，那真的很辛苦 有時候我認為…

147
00:09:58,190 --> 00:10:00,060
Wow!
哇

148
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:05,330
Nice move!
太帥了

149
00:10:05,570 --> 00:10:09,160
-"Where'd you grow up?" So simple. -Thank you.
-「你在哪裡長大的？」，太簡單了 -謝謝

150
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:12,400
Now, excuse me. I'm gonna use the restroom.
對不起，我要去洗手間

151
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:19,570
-Now you're watching me walk away. -Yes, I am! So simple!
-你正看著我走開 -沒錯，太簡單了

152
00:10:24,150 --> 00:10:28,650
-You won't believe what I did today. -Clearly not shower or shave.
-你一定不相信今天我做了什麼 -很明顯地你沒洗澡或刮鬍子

153
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:32,220
I played this all day, and now I rule.
我玩了這玩意一整天 現在我是第一名

154
00:10:32,490 --> 00:10:35,860
They should change the name to "Ms. Chandler."
他們應該把它改名為 「錢德小姐」

155
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:39,930
Although, I hope they don't.
還是不要好了

156
00:10:40,170 --> 00:10:45,470
You stayed home and played Ms. Pac-Man while I went to work like a chump?
你待在家裡玩小精靈 我出門像牛一樣在工作？

157
00:10:45,710 --> 00:10:50,580
I got the top 1 0 scores. I erased Phoebe off the board. High-five!
我包辦了前10名 把菲比給擠掉了，慶祝一下吧

158
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:54,950
What is the matter with your hand?
你的手是怎麼了？

159
00:10:57,820 --> 00:10:59,880
I played for eight hours.
我打了八小時的電動

160
00:11:00,090 --> 00:11:02,990
It'll loosen up. Check out the scores.
它會放鬆的，看看我的記錄

161
00:11:03,190 --> 00:11:06,590
Also, look at the initials. They're dirty words.
看看我編的名字 它們全是髒話

162
00:11:06,830 --> 00:11:11,030
-Chandler, why would you do that? -Because it's awesome.
-錢德，你為什麼要那麼做？ -因為它很棒

163
00:11:11,230 --> 00:11:12,820
You think it's clever?
你覺得那麼做很聰明？

164
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:18,200
They only give you three letters, so after A-S-S, it is a challenge.
我只能寫下三個字母 除了屁股外，其他的名字可是個大挑戰

165
00:11:18,670 --> 00:11:20,400
But clearly you're up to the task.
但你全都想出來了

166
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:25,740
-This one's not dirty. -Put it together with that one.
-這不是髒話 -把它跟那個連在一起

167
00:11:25,950 --> 00:11:27,210
Oh.
喔

168
00:11:27,450 --> 00:11:32,390
If you don't clear this off, you won't get one of those from me.
如果你沒辦法把它清掉 我不會答應你的

169
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:35,680
Ben's coming over tomorrow. This can't be there.
班明天會過來 不能讓他看到這個

170
00:11:35,890 --> 00:11:39,760
-He won't know what they mean. -He's 7, not stupid.
-他不知道它們的意思 -他七歲了，他不笨

171
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:44,290
-Have you talked to him lately? -I'm gonna unplug it.
-最近你跟他談過嗎？ -我要把插頭拔掉

172
00:11:44,530 --> 00:11:48,230
I'll have nothing to show for my day. Like work.
我沒辦法證明我今天做了什麼 就跟我的工作一樣

173
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,200
No!
不

174
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:53,300
Hey, look! It's still there!
你看，畫面還在

175
00:11:53,540 --> 00:11:57,310
This thing must have some kind of primitive ROM chip!
這玩意一定是用 原始的記憶晶片

176
00:11:57,750 --> 00:12:01,110
Wow. The dirty words and the computer talk.
你會說髒話 又懂電腦

177
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:03,180
This is just the coolest you've ever been.
這是你做過最酷的事

178
00:12:04,750 --> 00:12:07,780
-You gotta beat your scores. -With the claw?
-你得打敗自己的成績 -我的手指都張不開了

179
00:12:07,990 --> 00:12:11,420
Fine, I'll do it. We gotta get this off.
好吧，讓我來 我們得把這個消掉

180
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:15,620
Carol's still upset that you taught him "Pull my finger."
卡蘿還在氣 你教他「拉我的手指」

181
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:19,560
Pull my finger. My hand is messed up!
拉我的手指，我的手毀了

182
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:27,700
-I am not gonna answer that. -Oh, come on. Just pick one.
-我不會回答那個問題 -來吧，快挑一個

183
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:31,470
Between Monica, Phoebe, Chandler and Ross..
在摩妮卡，菲比 錢德跟羅斯之間…

184
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:34,200
if you had to, who would you punch?
如果你非那麼做不可 你會打誰？

185
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:38,050
We're friends. I wouldn't punch any of them.
我們是朋友，我不會打他們

186
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:40,210
Chandler?
錢德嗎？

187
00:12:40,490 --> 00:12:43,220
Yeah, but I don't know why.
對，但我不知道為什麼

188
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:47,550
-I'm having a wonderful time! -Me too!
-我玩得很開心 -我也是

189
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:51,630
-This is the best date I ever had. -I know!
-這是我最棒的約會經驗 -我知道

190
00:12:51,830 --> 00:12:55,500
I laughed so hard. Did you see the wine come out my nose?
我笑得好厲害 你看到酒從我鼻子噴出來嗎？

191
00:12:55,700 --> 00:12:58,370
Joey, I think everybody saw it.
喬伊，我想大家都看到了

192
00:12:58,970 --> 00:13:04,140
I never knew I could enjoy the non-sex part of a date so much.
我不知道我會這麼喜歡 沒有性愛的約會

193
00:13:04,350 --> 00:13:09,210
That's because you have never been on a date with me before.
那是因為 你沒有跟我約會過

194
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:12,640
All right. Now don't judge me.
好吧，別批評我

195
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:17,520
I normally wait till my date leaves, but I'm ripping into the swan.
通常我會等我的對象離開了再這麼做 但我真的餓壞了

196
00:13:17,730 --> 00:13:20,460
Okay, then you don't judge me.
好吧，你也別批評我

197
00:13:20,660 --> 00:13:24,190
I'm gonna suck on the cellophane from that brownie.
我要去舔蛋糕的包裝紙

198
00:13:33,310 --> 00:13:35,070
Oh, yeah.
對

199
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:40,000
So tell me, what are Joey Tribbiani's end-of-the-night moves?
告訴我喬伊崔比亞尼 說晚安的招數是什麼

200
00:13:42,350 --> 00:13:46,150
Well, if I want the girl to kiss me..
如果我要那個女孩吻我…

201
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:49,790
first, I make my lips look irresistible.
首先我會讓我的嘴巴 看起來難以抵抗

202
00:13:49,990 --> 00:13:51,250
How do you do it?
你都是怎麼做的？

203
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:55,390
Now you can't tell anyone, but..
你不能告訴任何人，但是…

204
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:59,060
I put on shiny lip balm.
我會塗上護唇膏

205
00:13:59,700 --> 00:14:04,830
-Oh, my God. -Like a moth to a flame, I tell you.
-天啊 -女人就跟飛蛾撲火一樣

206
00:14:05,340 --> 00:14:08,780
-Okay, now you go. -No, I don't want to tell you.
-好吧，輪到你了 -不，我不想告訴你

207
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:10,840
-Why not? -It's embarrassing.
-為什麼？ -那太丟臉了

208
00:14:11,210 --> 00:14:14,840
More embarrassing than shiny raspberry lip balm?
比塗覆盆子口味的護唇膏 還丟臉？

209
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:18,580
I didn't say raspberry before, did I?
我剛剛沒說覆盆子口味吧？

210
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:22,280
Just tell me, Rach. Just tell me.
快告訴我，瑞秋

211
00:14:22,590 --> 00:14:23,650
Okay.
好吧

212
00:14:23,890 --> 00:14:25,880
All right, stand up.
站起來

213
00:14:28,330 --> 00:14:30,660
Well, when we're at the door..
我們走到門邊時…

214
00:14:30,900 --> 00:14:35,730
I lightly press my lips against his.
我會將我的嘴唇 輕輕壓在他的嘴唇上

215
00:14:35,940 --> 00:14:40,170
Then move into his body, just for a second.
將身體靠向他 一秒鐘

216
00:14:40,410 --> 00:14:42,900
And then I make this sound:
然後我會發出這樣的聲音

217
00:14:48,550 --> 00:14:51,580
It doesn't sound like anything, but it works.
聽起來沒什麼 但很有效

218
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:55,050
Oh, yeah. That would work, yeah.
對，那的確有效

219
00:14:56,190 --> 00:15:00,750
All right, I gotta go to bed. I had such a wonderful time.
好吧，我得睡了 我玩得很開心

220
00:15:06,870 --> 00:15:08,860
Me too.
我也是

221
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:23,710
You were 50 minutes late? Did you crawl?
你遲到了50分鐘？ 你是用爬的嗎？

222
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,750
No, I ran, okay? It's really far.
不，我用跑的，那真的很遠

223
00:15:27,020 --> 00:15:31,220
When did people stop understanding "Get out of my way"?
人們什麼時候開始聽不懂 「別擋我的路」？

224
00:15:31,890 --> 00:15:33,790
Why didn't you take a cab?
你為什麼不搭計程車？

225
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:38,930
With the traffic and one-way streets, it'd take me twice as long.
塞車太嚴重，那是單行道 搭計程車得花兩倍的時間

226
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:43,930
And I have class three times a week. Who am I, Rockefeller?
我一星期有三堂課 我是洛克菲勒嗎？

227
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:47,140
You won't be able to keep doing this.
你沒辦法再繼續下去

228
00:15:47,370 --> 00:15:51,070
If I don't, they'll take the class away from me.
我不那麼做 他們會取消我這堂課

229
00:15:51,310 --> 00:15:54,300
And I put it in my family newsletter.
我把它登在我家的通訊報上

230
00:15:55,280 --> 00:15:58,880
-Your what? -You've seen it, The Geller Yeller.
-什麼？ -你看過的，蓋勒通訊報

231
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:03,380
Right. Wow.
對

232
00:16:03,590 --> 00:16:08,760
I figured out a faster route. I'm sure I can make it this time.
我想出一條比較快的路線 我想這次我能及時趕到

233
00:16:09,030 --> 00:16:14,160
I just can't be afraid to get a little bit hit by cars.
我不能害怕 被車子撞到

234
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:18,070
-Hey. -Hi!
-嘿 -嗨

235
00:16:18,470 --> 00:16:21,340
Remember when we talked about Cujo?
還記得我們談過《狂犬驚魂記》嗎？

236
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:24,840
I can't believe you haven't seen Cujo.
我不敢相信你沒看過《狂犬驚魂記》

237
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,070
Relax, it isn't Citizen Kane.
別緊張，它不是《公民凱恩》

238
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:30,440
Have you ever sat through Citizen Kane?
你看完了《公民凱恩》？

239
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:34,750
Yeah, it's really boring. But it's, like, a big deal.
對，它真的很無聊 但它是名片

240
00:16:35,190 --> 00:16:38,320
Anyway, I was thinking about renting Cujo.
總之，我想去租《狂犬驚魂記》

241
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,960
Well, let's do it tonight.
我們今晚一起看吧

242
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:44,760
-Don't you have that big date? -Oh, right.
-你不是有約會嗎？ -對

243
00:16:44,970 --> 00:16:48,370
-Hey, Joey, can I ask you something? -Yeah.
-喬伊，我能問你一件事嗎？ -問吧

244
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:51,470
After our date, did you feel weird?
昨晚約會後你覺不覺得怪怪的？

245
00:16:51,670 --> 00:16:56,370
Oh, my God. You did too? It freaked me out. What was that?
天啊，你也是嗎？ 我嚇壞了，那是什麼？

246
00:16:56,610 --> 00:17:02,110
I don't know. I'm kind of thinking it was the lobster.
我不知道 我想應該是龍蝦的問題

247
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:08,150
Oh, yeah. Yeah, the lobster.
對，龍蝦

248
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:11,720
-I was up sick all night. -Me too. All night.
-我吐了一整晚 -我也是

249
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:14,660
Really? We didn't cross paths.
真的嗎？我沒看到你

250
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:17,800
Yeah, well, that's because..
對，那是因為…

251
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,490
I stayed in my room.
我都待在房裡

252
00:17:21,370 --> 00:17:24,130
You don't want to look in my hamper.
你不會想看我的洗衣籃的

253
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,370
Okay, I got that.
我懂了

254
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:33,610
I'll escape there. I'll come back here.
我要逃離那裡 回到這裡

255
00:17:33,810 --> 00:17:36,540
All right. Come on, Ms. Pac-Man.
來吧，小精靈

256
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:41,880
Well, you're just a little bitch, aren't you?!
你是個混蛋，對吧？

257
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:46,050
Hey, you guys?
大家好

258
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:49,760
I'm sorry that I was hogging the game before.
抱歉之前 我霸佔著電動玩具

259
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:53,130
But if you don't get off soon, I will cut you.
如果你不快下來，我會殺了你

260
00:17:55,340 --> 00:18:01,370
Oh, my God! Your friends have some unfortunate initials.
天啊，你朋友名字的縮寫真難聽

261
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:03,040
They're all Chandler.
那都是錢德干的

262
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,580
Chandler couldn't get this good.
錢德不可能有這麼厲害

263
00:18:05,810 --> 00:18:10,650
I did. But it came at a price.
我很厲害，但那是要付出代價的

264
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:13,980
Ben's coming, and he can't see this.
班要過來，他不能看到這個

265
00:18:14,190 --> 00:18:17,650
By age 7, kids have already seen orgies.
七歲的孩子應該都看過雜交

266
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:23,320
Was it just me?
還是只有我而已？

267
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,400
So..
總之…

268
00:18:28,570 --> 00:18:30,090
we're about out of time.
我們沒時間了

269
00:18:30,270 --> 00:18:34,730
Now, I know I've given you a lot of new information.
我知道我提供你們很多新資訊

270
00:18:36,410 --> 00:18:38,640
And it may seem a little overwhelming.
那或許很嚇人

271
00:18:41,650 --> 00:18:43,710
But, if there's one thing..
但今天…

272
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:46,150
you need to take away from class today..
在課堂上 你們得學會一件事…

273
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:49,980
it's that..
那就是…

274
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:53,560
dinosaurs ain't never coming back.
恐龍永遠都不會復活

275
00:18:54,130 --> 00:18:56,600
I'll see you next time.
下次再見

276
00:19:09,710 --> 00:19:13,370
Yes, I made it! I'm on time!
我辦到了，我及時趕到

277
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:21,080
Okay, why don't we all..
好了，請大家…

278
00:19:23,090 --> 00:19:25,890
open our books to page 23..
翻到第23頁…

279
00:19:26,130 --> 00:19:27,560
where..
你們…

280
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,930
where you will see..
你們將會看到…

281
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:37,900
a bunch of red spots.
很多紅點

282
00:19:39,370 --> 00:19:44,310
Okay, why don't you all start to read while I..
請大家先看一下 我要…

283
00:19:51,250 --> 00:19:53,120
This is so embarrassing.
這真的是太不好意思了

284
00:19:53,290 --> 00:19:56,310
I just want to have a normal life.
我只想過正常人的生活

285
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:59,420
Wow, that's an expensive bottle of wine.
那瓶紅酒很貴的

286
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:01,530
It is?
是嗎？

287
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:04,030
That's funny, my fans don't normally do that.
真有趣 通常我的影迷不會那麼做

288
00:20:12,470 --> 00:20:16,000
Are you all right? You seem a little distracted.
你沒事嗎？ 你似乎有點心不在焉

289
00:20:16,210 --> 00:20:19,670
No, no, I'm fine. It's just..
不，我沒事，我只是…

290
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,950
Hey, can I ask you something?
我能問你一件事嗎？

291
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:26,050
Have you ever looked at someone you know..
你有沒有這樣的經驗 看著你認識的人…

292
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:29,850
and suddenly seen them in a different way?
突然間有不一樣的感覺？

293
00:20:30,060 --> 00:20:32,080
You mean like from behind?
你是說從背後看嗎？

294
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:40,030
Yeah. That's exactly it.
沒錯，就是那樣

295
00:20:40,230 --> 00:20:44,530
I saw this guy from behind, and he seemed totally normal.
我從背後看這個傢伙 覺得他真的很普通

296
00:20:44,770 --> 00:20:48,500
And then he turned around and it was Stephen Baldwin!
他一轉身 我才知道他是史蒂芬鮑德溫

297
00:20:49,610 --> 00:20:50,940
Yeah.
對

298
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:53,610
So you know exactly what I mean.
你完全瞭解我的意思

299
00:20:53,850 --> 00:20:57,110
Totally! Wow.
沒錯

300
00:20:58,690 --> 00:21:01,180
-Would you excuse me? -Sure.
-對不起 -請便

301
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:15,790
-Phoebe! You're on fire! -I know!
-菲比，你真的很厲害 -我知道

302
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:17,300
You can do it!
你辦得到

303
00:21:17,540 --> 00:21:19,530
-Don't touch me! -Don't touch her!
-別碰我 -別碰她

304
00:21:19,740 --> 00:21:22,040
Go left! Go right! Go right!
左邊，右邊，右邊

305
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:23,900
I can't! I can't!
我辦不到

306
00:21:24,140 --> 00:21:27,310
No! You son of a..
不，你這個天殺的…

307
00:21:40,390 --> 00:21:42,120
Phoebe?!
菲比

308
00:21:42,630 --> 00:21:46,400
Oh, hi, Ben. No, don't look at the machine!
嗨，班 不，別看機器

309
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:59,310
Thank God you're home! I'm watching Cujo.
謝天謝地你回來了 我在看《狂犬驚魂記》

310
00:21:59,550 --> 00:22:04,140
-Alone? -Yes! What is wrong with this dog?
-你一個人？ -對，這隻狗是怎麼了？

311
00:22:04,450 --> 00:22:08,480
Did you get to the part where Cujo throws himself at the car?
你看到庫裘 自己去撞車的那一幕了嗎？

312
00:22:08,690 --> 00:22:12,630
No, seriously, what's wrong with the dog?
不，真的 這隻狗是怎麼了？

313
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:15,330
Wait, what happened to your date?
等一下，你不是去約會了嗎？

314
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:17,920
Oh, it didn't work out.
我們之間不來電

315
00:22:18,130 --> 00:22:22,830
-Want to watch the rest of the movie? -Oh, okay. Yeah.
-你要跟我一起把電影看完嗎？ -好吧

316
00:22:23,100 --> 00:22:25,440
I never thought I'd say this..
我沒有想過我會這麼說…

317
00:22:25,670 --> 00:22:27,940
but I hope this dog dies.
但我希望這隻狗死掉

318
00:22:30,110 --> 00:22:33,100
What are you doing? Sit here. Protect me.
